1
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,359
Now that he's sick,

2
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,799
it completely shuts us up.

3
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:01,000
Whoever brings this up now

4
00:02:02,319 --> 00:02:03,439
is a total bastard.

5
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,799
Don't you ever get tired?

6
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,519
Obsessing over this crap all day long.

7
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:08,120
What?

8
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,039
Crap?

9
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,840
You call this crap, Sai Xiuming?

10
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:13,199
Dad's sick,

11
00:02:13,439 --> 00:02:14,680
but life has to go on.

12
00:02:14,919 --> 00:02:16,639
Things can't just stop because of him.

13
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,039
We still have our lives to live,

14
00:02:18,039 --> 00:02:18,599
don't we?

15
00:02:20,199 --> 00:02:20,960
Don't think I don't know

16
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,240
what's on your mind.

17
00:02:22,759 --> 00:02:23,879
With no tiger on the mountain,

18
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,599
you'd just let the second son rule the roost

19
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:26,199
and call it a day, right?

20
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:27,199
Let me tell you,

21
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,000
we just mind our own business,

22
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:29,719
and that's that.

23
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,159
Pathetic.

24
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:33,719
Just go to sleep.

25
00:02:34,919 --> 00:02:35,240
Turn off the light.

26
00:02:44,879 --> 00:02:46,400
Listen, is there noise in Dad's room?

27
00:02:47,919 --> 00:02:48,680
Listen! Listen!

28
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:50,520
Hear that?

29
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,840
Are you Second Brother from the Calabash Brothers?

30
00:03:01,439 --> 00:03:02,360
That's just Xiuhe.

31
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,479
In the dead of night?

32
00:03:04,479 --> 00:03:05,680
What's he doing in Dad's room?

33
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:07,719
Give it a rest.

34
00:03:07,719 --> 00:03:08,560
First you suspect the second brother,

35
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,400
now you're eyeing the third.

36
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,919
Xiuhe is in his own house.

37
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:11,680
Going into Dad's room,

38
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:12,319
what could he possibly do?

39
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:16,719
Look for the passbook!

40
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:17,680
What?

41
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:21,280
What are you doing?

42
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,479
Where are you going?

43
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:41,639
You scared me!

44
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:42,960
Don't you make any sound when you walk?

45
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,479
What are you doing?

46
00:03:46,719 --> 00:03:47,360
Can't you tell?

47
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:48,960
I'm looking for the passbook.

48
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:50,960
Sai Xiuhe.

49
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,240
You really have no shame.

50
00:03:53,479 --> 00:03:54,000
Shame?

51
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,319
What's shame good for?

52
00:03:56,199 --> 00:03:56,759
I don't buy for a second

53
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:58,599
that you and Eldest Brother aren't after the 14 million.

54
00:03:58,759 --> 00:03:59,719
You two care so much about saving face,

55
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,719
but I'd say you're just suffering for foolish pride.

56
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:02,520
It's the middle of the night.

57
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,439
Stop tearing the place apart.

58
00:04:03,759 --> 00:04:06,400
Are you sure the old man hid the passbook in this room?

59
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:07,560
I know the old man too well.

60
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,199
Even if my own mother were still around,

61
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:10,199
he wouldn't have even given it to her.

62
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,400
He doesn't trust anyone.

63
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,800
It's definitely hidden somewhere.

64
00:04:13,039 --> 00:04:13,639
If he can hide it,

65
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,800
I'm allowed to look for it.

66
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,199
So what if you find it?

67
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:17,560
You can't withdraw the money anyway.

68
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,279
There are plenty of pretty girls on the street.

69
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:20,920
Can I marry every single one of them?

70
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,439
Even just chatting with them one by one

71
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:24,600
would put me in a great mood!

72
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,000
Let me tell you,

73
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,439
you'd better hope I don't find this passbook.

74
00:04:28,759 --> 00:04:29,920
If I find this passbook,

75
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:31,360
I'll stuff it right into my pocket,

76
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,040
and I won't give it to anyone.

77
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:33,040
Don't just stand there.

78
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:33,439
Give me a hand.

79
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:35,480
Dad just had surgery,

80
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,759
and you're pulling this stunt?

81
00:04:36,959 --> 00:04:37,839
If Dad finds out,

82
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:38,720
think how heartbroken he'll be.

83
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,000
I swear, day in and day out,

84
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,000
you stand on your moral high ground.

85
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,759
Don't you get tired?

86
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:46,000
I, Sai Xiuhe, thought this room was dirty,

87
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:46,759
so I'm just tidying it up.

88
00:04:46,839 --> 00:04:48,160
Maybe that's why the old man got sick.

89
00:04:50,199 --> 00:04:50,720
Let me tell you,

90
00:04:51,079 --> 00:04:52,000
when it comes to this passbook,

91
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,199
whoever finds it pockets it.

92
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:54,399
Anyone who wants a cut

93
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,319
will have to get their permission.

94
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,560
Come on, Sai Xiuhe.

95
00:05:03,879 --> 00:05:05,160
You're making a racket in the dead of night,

96
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,240
leaving such a huge mess everywhere.

97
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,279
Won't I be the one who has to clean it up in the end?

98
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,439
Seriously!

99
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:20,279
What are you doing here?

100
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,879
Bed Three's surgery just ended.

101
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:22,480
Just came to take a look.

102
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,519
Don't worry, your father-in-law's doing fine.

103
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,399
The whole hospital knows about it.

104
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,720
Your family is great, though.

105
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,439
I heard the whole family came,

106
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,160
waiting outside the whole time during surgery.

107
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,240
You can hear me, right?

108
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:42,839
Uncle, don't worry.

109
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,600
Your family really cares about you.

110
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:45,759
You're truly blessed.

111
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,360
This is from when we took in Xiao Wu.

112
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,680
The blanket he was wrapped in.

113
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,560
Dad even kept this.

114
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,079
The pattern was pretty nice back then.

115
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:07,079
Doesn't even look out of style now.

116
00:06:09,879 --> 00:06:10,519
It smells funky.

117
00:06:11,839 --> 00:06:12,959
Needs a wash one of these days.

118
00:06:14,839 --> 00:06:17,000
What on earth has Dad been hoarding here?

119
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,040
Why is there even scrap metal?

120
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,519
This...

121
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,759
I think I've seen it somewhere.

122
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,160
That's Second Brother's.

123
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,439
Back in high school, playing soccer,

124
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:27,360
he broke his leg.

125
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,680
That fracture.

126
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,519
The steel plate put in his leg.

127
00:06:30,759 --> 00:06:32,079
Dad kept even this?

128
00:06:33,199 --> 00:06:34,360
He really favors Second Brother.

129
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:35,240
If he didn't favor Second Brother,

130
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:35,920
who else would he favor?

131
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:37,639
This is your second brother's too?

132
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,920
Why keep this piece of paper?

133
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:42,480
Don't damage this.

134
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,560
This is Qianjin's.

135
00:06:44,199 --> 00:06:45,680
The headpiece she wore on her 18th birthday.

136
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,279
Don't break it. Put it here.

137
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,360
If this gets broken,

138
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,360
the old man will be furious.

139
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:58,079
This is your second brother's college acceptance letter!

140
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:00,600
We definitely need to keep this safe.

141
00:07:01,759 --> 00:07:02,680
Of course we do.

142
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,879
He's the pride of our family line.

143
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:06,959
Out of all this stuff,

144
00:07:06,959 --> 00:07:08,040
there's nothing of Big Brother's.

145
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:09,639
Whose cassette tape is this?

146
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:10,959
Yours or Qianjin's?

147
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,879
"Should I Leave Quietly."

148
00:07:14,959 --> 00:07:15,800
That's my big brother's.

149
00:07:18,319 --> 00:07:19,959
Why would your big brother leave quietly?

150
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,279
If he didn't leave quietly,

151
00:07:21,279 --> 00:07:22,079
who would?

152
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,639
Back when he was going through puberty,

153
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,160
he'd crush on eight girls a day.

154
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:26,560
Didn't dare tell a single one.

155
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,040
He'd come home sulking,

156
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,279
tossing and turning in bed like a pancake,

157
00:07:29,279 --> 00:07:30,040
just listening to this song.

158
00:07:30,439 --> 00:07:31,040
Let me tell you,

159
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:32,560
if he hadn't met you,

160
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,839
his life would still be pure darkness.

161
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,360
What on earth did Dad keep all this for?

162
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,120
What are you doing?

163
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,240
Reminiscing?

164
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:42,560
Find the passbook!

165
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:44,319
What are you guys doing?

166
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:45,560
Up so late instead of sleeping.

167
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:46,439
Seriously, it's this late.

168
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:47,519
Why aren't you guys in bed?

169
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,920
We have school tomorrow.

170
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,319
With all your clattering downstairs,

171
00:07:50,319 --> 00:07:51,399
who can sleep?

172
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,040
Your grandpa's room is just too messy.

173
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,120
We're just helping tidy it up.

174
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:55,839
It's bad for feng shui.

175
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:56,560
You two brats wouldn't understand.

176
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,040
Go back upstairs.

177
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:59,879
What's this? Whose tooth is it?

178
00:08:00,759 --> 00:08:01,319
Xiao Wu's, maybe?

179
00:08:03,959 --> 00:08:04,600
Not mine.

180
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,879
Might be yours, Third Brother.

181
00:08:08,879 --> 00:08:09,519
No way.

182
00:08:10,079 --> 00:08:10,920
Then it must be Qianjin's.

183
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,360
Even if Qianjin let out a fart,

184
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,600
Dad would think it smells sweet.

185
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:15,040
The old man would never keep my stuff.

186
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:16,040
Zhenzhu,

187
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,759
see if there's an empty jar.

188
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:19,000
If there is, don't open it.

189
00:08:19,079 --> 00:08:20,279
It probably has Qianjin's fart trapped inside.

190
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,160
Look at this old man.

191
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,240
Hoarding all this junk every day.

192
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,000
What's he keeping it for?

193
00:08:25,439 --> 00:08:26,920
This isn't junk.

194
00:08:27,199 --> 00:08:28,079
You don't have kids.

195
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,279
You wouldn't understand.

196
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:31,639
The old man has no real skills,

197
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,720
so he poured it all into stashing stuff.

198
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:34,799
Who's he hiding it from?

199
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:35,720
From thieves?

200
00:08:52,399 --> 00:08:54,039
The clatter of the children

201
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:56,000
rummaging up the past

202
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,679
felt like countless hands

203
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:02,759
pulling Sai Duoxi back from the darkness.

204
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,440
He struggled,

205
00:09:06,879 --> 00:09:09,120
wanting his second son to pull him up,

206
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,799
yet he couldn't make a sound.

207
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:51,440
Jingran,

208
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,080
I'm on my way to the hospital right now.

209
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:54,600
I'll call you when I get there.

210
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:28,240
Dad.

211
00:10:31,279 --> 00:10:31,559
Dad.

212
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,320
I dreamed about you.

213
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,279
Dreamed you were calling me.

214
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:26,960
Xiuming.

215
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:29,759
Aren't you supposed to visit your dad?

216
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:30,440
No need.

217
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:31,679
My fourth sister's husband said

218
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:32,600
that in the ICU,

219
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,720
we wouldn't be allowed in anyway.

220
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:34,840
Going would be pointless.

221
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,039
He said once my dad

222
00:11:36,039 --> 00:11:36,399
Uncle Ma,

223
00:11:36,399 --> 00:11:37,120
gets out, then we'll...

224
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:39,600
What are you...

225
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,120
Are you trying to go out?

226
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,080
Xiuliang is here.

227
00:11:44,399 --> 00:11:45,559
Xiuming, put me down.

228
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:47,279
Put— Put me down first.

229
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:50,360
Take it easy.

230
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:51,720
Steady... steady on your feet.

231
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,360
Here, Dad, Dad...

232
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:52,759
I'm fine.

233
00:11:53,879 --> 00:11:54,320
All right.

234
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:55,720
Well...

235
00:11:56,879 --> 00:11:58,440
I called Xiuliang over.

236
00:11:58,759 --> 00:12:00,279
I have something to discuss with him.

237
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:03,279
Wait outside for a moment.

238
00:12:04,799 --> 00:12:06,080
Go wait outside for a bit.

239
00:12:09,559 --> 00:12:09,879
Jiao,

240
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,360
you— you go out too.

241
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,039
You get out too.

242
00:12:13,039 --> 00:12:13,559
Okay.

243
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:15,000
I'll leave this right here for you.

244
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:15,799
Good, good.

245
00:12:17,279 --> 00:12:18,200
Call me if you need anything, Dad.

246
00:12:19,639 --> 00:12:20,159
Brother Xiuliang.

247
00:12:20,919 --> 00:12:21,960
Shut the door tight.

248
00:12:25,799 --> 00:12:26,039
Sure.

249
00:12:26,879 --> 00:12:27,240
Uncle Ma,

250
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:28,840
what's this about? Why so secretive?

251
00:12:29,159 --> 00:12:29,720
Xiuliang,

252
00:12:31,399 --> 00:12:33,039
in my room,

253
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,279
under the pillow,

254
00:12:34,639 --> 00:12:36,279
there's a cloth parcel.

255
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:37,840
Bring it over for me.

256
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,320
Why did your— your dad

257
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:45,320
call Xiuliang over?

258
00:12:45,759 --> 00:12:46,279
What's it about?

259
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,080
I don't know.

260
00:12:53,519 --> 00:12:54,919
Before my dad went to the hospital,

261
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,519
didn't he come to see your dad?

262
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:00,720
Then you must know what it's about.

263
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,120
Tell me.

264
00:13:02,639 --> 00:13:03,639
Calling— Calling Xiuliang over,

265
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:04,559
what for?

266
00:13:05,879 --> 00:13:06,440
Hard to say.

267
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:09,720
All right, all right.

268
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:11,440
I get it.

269
00:13:12,039 --> 00:13:12,440
Look,

270
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,000
I won't put you in a tough spot.

271
00:13:14,279 --> 00:13:14,720
How about this?

272
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:16,720
I'll guess.

273
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,440
If I guess right,

274
00:13:18,879 --> 00:13:19,720
just nod.

275
00:13:19,759 --> 00:13:21,320
That way, it won't count as you telling me.

276
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,600
Did my dad

277
00:13:24,399 --> 00:13:25,440
want your dad to talk Xiuliang into

278
00:13:25,799 --> 00:13:26,799
going back to work at the Port Authority?

279
00:13:29,639 --> 00:13:31,080
Or did he want your dad to tell him

280
00:13:31,679 --> 00:13:32,440
to give up his company

281
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:32,960
and shut it down immediately?

282
00:13:36,679 --> 00:13:37,240
Then again,

283
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,360
those two are kind of the same thing.

284
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,159
Uncle Ma,

285
00:13:41,799 --> 00:13:42,559
take a look. Is this it?

286
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:43,919
Good.

287
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:45,720
Xiuliang,

288
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:47,159
have a seat first.

289
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:48,399
Sit down.

290
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,840
Your father...

291
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,360
right before he went to the hospital,

292
00:13:56,639 --> 00:13:58,240
made a special trip to see me.

293
00:13:58,639 --> 00:13:59,399
He told me

294
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:01,639
to hand this thing

295
00:14:02,039 --> 00:14:03,679
over to you in person.

296
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,200
He said it was his greatest wish,

297
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:08,200
that it had to be given to

298
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,759
someone he truly trusts.

299
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:12,120
Th-This— This won't do, Uncle Ma.

300
00:14:12,279 --> 00:14:13,519
My— My eldest brother is right here.

301
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,440
Let me call him in.

302
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:15,639
Whatever important matter you have,

303
00:14:15,639 --> 00:14:16,200
and this parcel...

304
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,120
let's talk about it together.

305
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:17,480
Stop right there!

306
00:14:17,879 --> 00:14:18,240
Come back!

307
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:19,159
I'll go call him in.

308
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:19,879
No!

309
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:20,600
Get back here right now!

310
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:21,519
Sit down!

311
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,799
Don't upset me. Sit down!

312
00:14:31,159 --> 00:14:31,639
Xiuliang,

313
00:14:32,279 --> 00:14:33,000
your dad said

314
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,200
to let your big brother run the crew,

315
00:14:35,879 --> 00:14:37,559
and have you manage the books and signing.

316
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:39,440
Brothers working together

317
00:14:39,919 --> 00:14:40,960
to look after this family.

318
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,399
Uncle Ma, be the judge here.

319
00:14:43,799 --> 00:14:44,559
Work on a construction site...

320
00:14:44,559 --> 00:14:45,600
I know nothing about it.

321
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,120
If you hand it over to me,

322
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:46,960
what am I supposed to do?

323
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:47,480
It's just like...

324
00:14:47,799 --> 00:14:49,039
would you take your own crew's business

325
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:51,000
and hand it to Ma Laibu and Ma Laijiao?

326
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:51,480
You wouldn't either.

327
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:53,120
Nobody knows it right from the start.

328
00:14:54,639 --> 00:14:56,720
Back when your dad and I started out together,

329
00:14:57,039 --> 00:14:58,279
compared to you now,

330
00:14:58,279 --> 00:14:59,679
we were nowhere near as capable.

331
00:14:59,879 --> 00:15:02,039
With your smarts, you'll pick it right up.

332
00:15:02,039 --> 00:15:03,799
No, Uncle Ma, I'm a lawyer.

333
00:15:03,799 --> 00:15:04,200
Xiuliang,

334
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,679
you have to take it.

335
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:08,759
I know.

336
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,240
Could it be that Dad...

337
00:15:12,679 --> 00:15:14,080
might know that this time

338
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:15,120
he won't make it off the operating table?

339
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,519
Is there something so important in our family

340
00:15:17,759 --> 00:15:18,399
that your dad

341
00:15:20,679 --> 00:15:22,159
would only entrust it to Second Brother?

342
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:23,799
Is it about our family's...

343
00:15:23,799 --> 00:15:25,399
that 14.2 million?

344
00:15:27,679 --> 00:15:28,200
No.

345
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:32,399
No? Then... then...

346
00:15:33,159 --> 00:15:35,039
what did he want Second Brother for?

347
00:15:36,519 --> 00:15:36,960
Xiuliang,

348
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:40,600
your dad and I have been brothers for decades.

349
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,399
Going into surgery...

350
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,519
this is a matter of life and death.

351
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,519
He gave me such a huge task,

352
00:15:47,799 --> 00:15:49,320
which shows how much he trusts me.

353
00:15:49,519 --> 00:15:50,559
If you don't take it,

354
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,240
at my age, I...

355
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,759
I can't break my word to him.

356
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:01,879
Uncle Ma, you...

357
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:03,480
What are you doing?

358
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:03,840
Why are you...

359
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:04,559
That day,

360
00:16:05,919 --> 00:16:07,320
your dad was sitting right here.

361
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:09,919
He held my hand and told me,

362
00:16:10,399 --> 00:16:12,600
"If Xiuliang won't take it,

363
00:16:13,039 --> 00:16:14,240
tell him

364
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,679
this is my dying wish."

365
00:16:16,679 --> 00:16:17,480
Uncle Ma, please, don't cry.

366
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:20,279
I couldn't bring myself to say no!

367
00:16:22,799 --> 00:16:24,440
Uncle Ma, it's getting late.

368
00:16:24,879 --> 00:16:25,919
You still have to go to the hospital,

369
00:16:26,039 --> 00:16:26,440
all right?

370
00:16:26,559 --> 00:16:27,240
Your health comes first.

371
00:16:27,559 --> 00:16:28,559
Something this important...

372
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:29,759
give me some time to think it over.

373
00:16:29,759 --> 00:16:30,320
We'll talk later.

374
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:30,879
Hold on! Hold on.

375
00:16:31,679 --> 00:16:32,559
Help me up first.

376
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,720
Help me up first!

377
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,879
I'm a sick man!

378
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,919
Where do you think you're going?

379
00:16:38,919 --> 00:16:40,000
Uncle Ma, let go of me.

380
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:40,639
Let me tell you,

381
00:16:40,759 --> 00:16:41,559
today, these ledgers...

382
00:16:41,559 --> 00:16:42,399
you take them if you want,

383
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:43,639
and you take them even if you don't!

384
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:45,120
Otherwise, I won't let you leave!

385
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:45,559
Uncle Ma...

386
00:16:45,559 --> 00:16:47,159
I won't let you leave!

387
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:49,840
Uncle Ma,

388
00:16:50,519 --> 00:16:51,399
let me ask you one thing.

389
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,799
If I hadn't come today,

390
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:55,240
or if I didn't take these ledgers,

391
00:16:55,799 --> 00:16:57,600
did my dad have a backup plan?

392
00:16:58,679 --> 00:16:59,080
No.

393
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:00,360
Absolutely not.

394
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:02,840
You...

395
00:17:03,159 --> 00:17:04,839
just take them.

396
00:17:05,279 --> 00:17:07,000
He only trusts you!

397
00:17:10,039 --> 00:17:11,480
Xiuliang...

398
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:16,799
Second Brother!

399
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:24,839
Are you even human?

400
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,079
Don't you know how to talk?

401
00:17:27,359 --> 00:17:28,640
You... You see your older brother and act like this?

402
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:29,279
Eldest Brother, Eldest Brother!

403
00:17:29,599 --> 00:17:30,559
We're running out of time.

404
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,160
Let's go. Hurry up.

405
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:32,759
Wait, what—

406
00:17:32,799 --> 00:17:33,200
Come on, let's go.

407
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:33,880
He sees me and—

408
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:35,519
What kind of attitude is that?

409
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:36,119
Th-This... What's this?

410
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,200
The mouthwash is over here.

411
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:40,240
This one.

412
00:17:42,079 --> 00:17:43,839
A small bottle of mouthwash is enough.

413
00:17:43,839 --> 00:17:45,279
Dad will only use it for a couple of days.

414
00:17:45,359 --> 00:17:46,599
In a few days, he can brush his teeth.

415
00:17:46,599 --> 00:17:47,799
It's fine, get the big one.

416
00:17:49,279 --> 00:17:50,160
Wait, if you get the big one,

417
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:51,319
I'm the one who has to pay for it.

418
00:17:51,319 --> 00:17:52,519
We barely have any living allowance left.

419
00:17:52,519 --> 00:17:53,359
What if we run out?

420
00:17:53,359 --> 00:17:54,039
How are we supposed to eat?

421
00:17:54,039 --> 00:17:55,599
I said get the big one, so get the big one.

422
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,039
Dad's card is with me.

423
00:18:00,519 --> 00:18:01,720
Dad's card is with you?

424
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,839
He gave it to me before his surgery.

425
00:18:04,079 --> 00:18:05,359
He said he only trusted me with it.

426
00:18:06,599 --> 00:18:06,880
Right.

427
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,680
Only someone named Sai can be trusted.

428
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:12,319
Toothbrush.

429
00:18:13,119 --> 00:18:14,039
Dad doesn't like green.

430
00:18:14,359 --> 00:18:14,960
Get the red one.

431
00:18:16,119 --> 00:18:17,359
Since when did Dad dislike green?

432
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:19,519
It's been like that forever.

433
00:18:19,519 --> 00:18:20,279
How do you not know?

434
00:18:22,079 --> 00:18:22,680
I do know.

435
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:24,599
I just think he's superstitious.

436
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:25,559
Red.

437
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:28,960
Wait, this one won't do.

438
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:30,039
The bristles are too hard.

439
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:32,400
Dad's lower right tooth—

440
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:34,039
he got it filled at a cheap place last year.

441
00:18:34,359 --> 00:18:35,759
It's been sensitive ever since.

442
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,160
He needs soft bristles like these.

443
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:38,960
When did Dad get a tooth filled?

444
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:39,759
Why didn't I know about it?

445
00:18:41,079 --> 00:18:41,559
Exactly.

446
00:18:42,279 --> 00:18:42,839
You're his daughter.

447
00:18:42,839 --> 00:18:43,680
How could you not know?

448
00:18:45,839 --> 00:18:46,519
Bed pads.

449
00:18:47,039 --> 00:18:47,720
Sitz bath.

450
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:49,119
First your mom went through it,

451
00:18:49,799 --> 00:18:50,559
and now Dad's going through it too.

452
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:54,640
He's recovering quite well.

453
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:55,200
Look.

454
00:18:55,319 --> 00:18:55,839
He can walk already.

455
00:18:57,039 --> 00:18:57,519
Stick with the treatment.

456
00:18:57,680 --> 00:18:58,319
Don't give up.

457
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,440
It's great that your dad can walk now.

458
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:00,960
He can walk,

459
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:01,920
but if he can walk, he can also fall.

460
00:19:02,319 --> 00:19:03,079
Once he gets back home,

461
00:19:03,519 --> 00:19:04,680
handrails must be installed on the walls.

462
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,920
Put non-slip tiles in the bathroom and shower.

463
00:19:07,519 --> 00:19:09,200
Also, a walker and a cane—

464
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:10,119
you must have those ready too.

465
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:10,519
By the way,

466
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:12,119
the toilet needs to be raised.

467
00:19:12,599 --> 00:19:13,839
Otherwise, sitting and getting up will be hard.

468
00:19:14,119 --> 00:19:14,359
Okay.

469
00:19:14,359 --> 00:19:15,000
Take note of this.

470
00:19:15,079 --> 00:19:15,880
Have your partner get on it right away.

471
00:19:16,799 --> 00:19:17,599
The toilet, got it.

472
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:18,519
I understand.

473
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:20,480
Don't worry about this.

474
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:21,039
I'll take care of it.

475
00:19:21,279 --> 00:19:21,759
Thank you.

476
00:19:22,039 --> 00:19:22,440
No problem.

477
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:30,920
What are you picking out yarn for?

478
00:19:32,279 --> 00:19:33,319
To knit Dad a vest.

479
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:34,759
Does this color look good?

480
00:19:36,559 --> 00:19:37,799
Just buy a ready-made one.

481
00:19:37,799 --> 00:19:39,200
It saves trouble and looks better.

482
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:41,680
What kind of person is Dad?

483
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:42,480
Don't you know?

484
00:19:43,279 --> 00:19:43,880
If you save effort,

485
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,240
it means you won't bother for him.

486
00:19:45,759 --> 00:19:46,720
And not bothering for him

487
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:47,640
means you're unfilial.

488
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:49,640
You're a deadbeat, a bastard, an ingrate!

489
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:51,039
Then you won't be allowed at the dinner table,

490
00:19:51,039 --> 00:19:52,200
or get a cut of the money!

491
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,119
Jelly packed with real fruit!

492
00:19:57,119 --> 00:19:58,000
Free samples!

493
00:19:58,559 --> 00:20:00,839
Zhenzhu said she wanted jelly the other day.

494
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:02,599
I'll take a bag for her.

495
00:20:02,599 --> 00:20:04,039
I'll tell her Grandpa bought it for her.

496
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,640
Whoever wants a seat at the table can take it.

497
00:20:14,759 --> 00:20:16,160
Whoever wants to eat can eat.

498
00:20:16,839 --> 00:20:17,720
Anyway, Dad said

499
00:20:18,039 --> 00:20:18,759
my share

500
00:20:19,039 --> 00:20:20,000
was set aside for me long ago.

501
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:21,680
Right.

502
00:20:22,559 --> 00:20:23,599
Dad spoils you so much.

503
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:28,160
What's up?

504
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,799
I'm buying stuff for Dad.

505
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:33,440
Didn't you make the list?

506
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:35,799
All right, I'm hanging up then.

507
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,640
Jingran?

508
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:41,319
Still mad?

509
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:44,559
Not at all.

510
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:45,720
Doing great.

511
00:20:47,279 --> 00:20:48,480
Just gave me 10,000 yuan.

512
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:50,440
There's nothing money can't solve.

513
00:20:51,400 --> 00:20:51,839
Right.

514
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:53,799
Must be nice having money.

515
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:55,319
It's Dad's card.

516
00:21:00,599 --> 00:21:02,359
Don't worry, the money...

517
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,319
will be here in a minute.

518
00:21:03,319 --> 00:21:04,920
That's 1,000 rebar rods in total.

519
00:21:05,079 --> 00:21:05,880
Manager Xiuming.

520
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:07,079
It's no good.

521
00:21:07,559 --> 00:21:08,240
What's no good?

522
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:09,640
Qingyou said...

523
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:10,920
your signature isn't valid.

524
00:21:11,119 --> 00:21:11,759
He won't release the funds.

525
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:13,240
My signature isn't valid?

526
00:21:13,359 --> 00:21:14,359
Yeah, that's what Yang Qingyou said.

527
00:21:14,359 --> 00:21:14,680
All right then.

528
00:21:15,839 --> 00:21:16,359
Yang Qingyou!

529
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:17,400
Yang Qingyou!

530
00:21:18,079 --> 00:21:18,799
Get over here!

531
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:20,559
Wait, look, I'm just... I...

532
00:21:20,599 --> 00:21:21,480
Get over here right now!

533
00:21:24,319 --> 00:21:24,880
What's that supposed to mean?

534
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:25,960
My signature doesn't count?

535
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,519
Settle up their payment!

536
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:29,119
Your signature just isn't valid.

537
00:21:29,119 --> 00:21:29,680
Are you out of your mind?

538
00:21:30,599 --> 00:21:31,559
Settle the payment right now

539
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:32,279
so they can leave!

540
00:21:33,119 --> 00:21:33,759
Let's talk in private.

541
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:35,240
In private? About what?

542
00:21:35,279 --> 00:21:35,920
Say it right here.

543
00:21:36,559 --> 00:21:37,039
What's going on?

544
00:21:37,119 --> 00:21:37,559
Look,

545
00:21:37,920 --> 00:21:39,400
call your family.

546
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:40,839
Ask them what's going on.

547
00:21:41,039 --> 00:21:41,799
Have you lost your mind?

548
00:21:42,359 --> 00:21:43,119
My dad's in the hospital!

549
00:21:43,119 --> 00:21:44,000
Who am I supposed to call?

550
00:21:44,279 --> 00:21:45,359
Besides, whenever my dad wasn't around,

551
00:21:45,519 --> 00:21:46,400
my signature always worked!

552
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:47,920
Just call and ask right now!

553
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:49,400
See who actually calls the shots.

554
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:50,279
Don't you have any idea?

555
00:21:50,279 --> 00:21:51,359
I don't call the shots?

556
00:21:51,359 --> 00:21:52,119
My word counts the most!

557
00:21:52,119 --> 00:21:53,039
Just ask them.

558
00:21:53,039 --> 00:21:54,000
Make the call and ask!

559
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:54,920
Ask? Who do I ask?

560
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:55,880
Ask this, ask that...

561
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:57,079
Aren't you just wasting time?

562
00:21:57,079 --> 00:21:57,400
You're...

563
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:59,200
Is making a phone call that hard?

564
00:21:59,559 --> 00:22:00,400
You just wait!

565
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:03,039
Princess,

566
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:04,599
hurry up!

567
00:22:04,599 --> 00:22:06,400
I still have to take this stuff to the hospital.

568
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:07,640
Do you think wearing this outfit

569
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:09,400
makes me look really professional?

570
00:22:09,839 --> 00:22:11,160
Why do you need to look professional?

571
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:12,079
What you're wearing right now

572
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:13,119
makes you look like a pretty butterfly.

573
00:22:13,119 --> 00:22:13,680
It looks nice.

574
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:15,160
I have to go to work too.

575
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:17,240
Work?

576
00:22:17,960 --> 00:22:19,039
Since when do you work?

577
00:22:20,119 --> 00:22:20,559
Right away.

578
00:22:21,319 --> 00:22:22,720
Second Brother found me a place.

579
00:22:23,119 --> 00:22:23,839
I'm going for an interview.

580
00:22:25,680 --> 00:22:26,559
I'll start right away.

581
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:27,960
Wait a minute.

582
00:22:28,559 --> 00:22:29,720
Dad just had surgery,

583
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:30,440
and you're running off to work?

584
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:31,200
Who's taking care of Dad?

585
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:32,640
There are nurses at the hospital,

586
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:33,559
and at home, there's you.

587
00:22:34,039 --> 00:22:35,440
I wouldn't be much help anyway.

588
00:22:38,039 --> 00:22:39,720
Aren't you carefree?

589
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:41,920
Dad had such major surgery,

590
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:43,279
and you, missy, just shrug your shoulders

591
00:22:43,279 --> 00:22:44,039
and dump him on me?

592
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:46,200
Aren't you worried I won't care for him well?

593
00:22:47,039 --> 00:22:47,799
Of course not.

594
00:22:47,799 --> 00:22:48,720
You'll do a great job.

595
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:51,119
Hello, Xiuming?

596
00:22:51,119 --> 00:22:51,640
Hurry up and

597
00:22:51,839 --> 00:22:52,440
come over to the construction site.

598
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:53,319
Sign this.

599
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:55,039
Hello?

600
00:22:58,559 --> 00:22:59,200
Big Brother?

601
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:00,920
Were you arguing?

602
00:23:02,960 --> 00:23:03,519
No.

603
00:23:04,559 --> 00:23:05,240
Everything's fine.

604
00:23:06,359 --> 00:23:06,640
Dad...

605
00:23:07,319 --> 00:23:07,920
You and your big brother...

606
00:23:08,519 --> 00:23:08,839
you both...

607
00:23:09,759 --> 00:23:10,920
sound identical on the phone.

608
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:27,880
What's going on?

609
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:29,039
We had to wait for you, didn't we?

610
00:23:29,319 --> 00:23:29,720
What's this about?

611
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:31,000
You have the biggest say in the family now,

612
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:31,319
don't you?

613
00:23:31,519 --> 00:23:32,599
It's just some pocket change for the site,

614
00:23:32,799 --> 00:23:33,880
and I have to grovel for your approval?

615
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:35,000
I've been waiting for over an hour.

616
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:35,839
Are you approving the money or not?

617
00:23:35,839 --> 00:23:36,480
Stop yelling!

618
00:23:36,799 --> 00:23:37,640
Just say what you need to say.

619
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:39,319
Yang Qingyou!

620
00:23:39,839 --> 00:23:40,119
Come out here!

621
00:23:41,160 --> 00:23:41,559
What is it?

622
00:23:42,599 --> 00:23:43,319
Come... come over here.

623
00:23:44,039 --> 00:23:44,519
Sign it for him.

624
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:46,240
Sign what?

625
00:23:46,319 --> 00:23:47,079
If you don't sign,

626
00:23:47,240 --> 00:23:47,880
he won't release the funds.

627
00:23:48,519 --> 00:23:49,640
Who told you she had to sign?

628
00:23:51,079 --> 00:23:52,039
Uncle Duoxi did.

629
00:23:52,039 --> 00:23:52,759
Back then, he said...

630
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:54,680
Before your Uncle Duoxi went into surgery,

631
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:55,880
he gave me instructions.

632
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:57,160
Whatever Dad arranged,

633
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:58,119
we just do that.

634
00:23:58,119 --> 00:23:59,599
What are you shouting for?

635
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:00,640
Where? Where do I sign?

636
00:24:01,519 --> 00:24:01,759
Here.

637
00:24:04,240 --> 00:24:05,240
What the hell are you doing?

638
00:24:05,400 --> 00:24:06,119
Everyone is standing right here!

639
00:24:06,279 --> 00:24:06,880
Hurry up.

640
00:24:07,079 --> 00:24:07,640
They're waiting.

641
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:08,880
Was I speaking English or what?

642
00:24:09,079 --> 00:24:11,359
I said get the person in charge of your family to sign!

643
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:12,279
Isn't that what I said?

644
00:24:13,799 --> 00:24:14,720
Before Dad's surgery,

645
00:24:15,480 --> 00:24:16,079
he told me

646
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:18,319
he was leaving this family in my hands!

647
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:21,119
Did you hear that?

648
00:24:21,119 --> 00:24:22,119
The person in charge is standing right here!

649
00:24:22,119 --> 00:24:22,799
Dad already said

650
00:24:23,039 --> 00:24:23,759
she's in charge!

651
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:26,160
What's wrong with your brains?

652
00:24:26,839 --> 00:24:27,880
Think carefully about it.

653
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,960
Who in your family actually has the authority here?

654
00:24:31,599 --> 00:24:32,400
What a hassle.

655
00:24:35,119 --> 00:24:36,640
You could've just explained it over the phone!

656
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:38,480
The bill could've been settled by now!

657
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:39,119
Such a waste of time!

658
00:24:41,799 --> 00:24:43,079
Why drag me out here? Why?

659
00:24:44,480 --> 00:24:44,839
Out of my way!

660
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:49,880
Your family can't even sort out your own mess.

661
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:50,599
What are you all staring at?

662
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:51,440
Get back to work!

663
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:52,480
Stop looking!

664
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:53,400
The show's over!

665
00:24:56,960 --> 00:24:57,480
Call him.

666
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:58,680
Forget it!

667
00:24:58,799 --> 00:25:00,039
That's between you two brothers.

668
00:25:00,039 --> 00:25:00,559
You call him.

669
00:25:00,559 --> 00:25:01,839
I told you to call Second Brother!

670
00:25:01,839 --> 00:25:02,680
I'm not calling. Why should I?

671
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:03,160
You call him!

672
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:03,680
I... You call!

673
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:04,079
You call!

674
00:25:04,079 --> 00:25:04,400
I'm not calling!

675
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:05,039
If you won't call, I'll hit you!

676
00:25:05,039 --> 00:25:05,960
I'll call! I'll call! I'll call!

677
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:06,920
Unbelievable...

678
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:08,000
Wouldn't it be easier if you just called him?

679
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:08,599
Hurry up!

680
00:25:08,599 --> 00:25:09,519
Stop wasting time!

681
00:25:14,599 --> 00:25:15,319
Qingyou, what's wrong?

682
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:16,480
Brother Liang,

683
00:25:16,759 --> 00:25:18,039
they're waiting for the payout at the site.

684
00:25:18,160 --> 00:25:18,680
Sai Xiuliang!

685
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:19,599
Let me tell you right now,

686
00:25:19,759 --> 00:25:20,440
get over here this instant!

687
00:25:20,680 --> 00:25:21,640
Be here in half an hour!

688
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:22,200
Did you hear me?

689
00:25:22,559 --> 00:25:23,599
In a minute, the workers will shut down

690
00:25:23,599 --> 00:25:24,119
and walk off!

691
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:25,640
Work and materials will all stall here!

692
00:25:25,759 --> 00:25:27,839
You'll cover the late penalties and lost-work fees!

693
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:29,680
If you really can't make it,

694
00:25:29,759 --> 00:25:31,119
text us an authorization!

695
00:25:31,519 --> 00:25:32,119
Get over here now!

696
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:32,799
He must be here in person!

697
00:25:32,920 --> 00:25:33,640
Doesn't he want to sign off?

698
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:34,519
He wants to act like the boss, doesn't he?

699
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,240
He won't show his face at the site,

700
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:36,240
yet he hoards the seal and plays boss?

701
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,000
Not a chance!

702
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:39,000
Right, right... Hey, you—

703
00:25:40,039 --> 00:25:40,480
He hung up.

704
00:25:40,720 --> 00:25:41,000
You...

705
00:25:58,079 --> 00:25:58,640
Look, buddy,

706
00:25:59,039 --> 00:26:00,200
you can't park like this.

707
00:26:00,359 --> 00:26:01,559
You've blocked the whole road.

708
00:26:01,559 --> 00:26:02,359
Save it. Don't give me that.

709
00:26:02,359 --> 00:26:03,319
Move it over a bit.

710
00:26:03,400 --> 00:26:04,039
Pay me, and I'll leave.

711
00:26:04,039 --> 00:26:05,039
Move aside and let our trucks through.

712
00:26:05,160 --> 00:26:05,960
Our trucks can't get out,

713
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:06,599
and we can't haul materials.

714
00:26:06,599 --> 00:26:07,079
If work stops for a day,

715
00:26:07,079 --> 00:26:07,759
can you take the blame for that?

716
00:26:07,759 --> 00:26:08,480
Don't talk to me.

717
00:26:08,680 --> 00:26:09,359
Talk to whoever's in charge!

718
00:26:09,359 --> 00:26:10,119
Why give us a hard time?

719
00:26:10,119 --> 00:26:10,960
Once I get my money,

720
00:26:10,960 --> 00:26:11,720
I'm out of here.

721
00:26:11,720 --> 00:26:12,759
Whoever owes you money,

722
00:26:12,759 --> 00:26:13,599
go ask them!

723
00:26:13,799 --> 00:26:14,519
No one said you won't get paid.

724
00:26:14,519 --> 00:26:15,000
Is there anyone here

725
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:16,519
who actually calls the shots?

726
00:26:16,519 --> 00:26:16,880
Brother Liang.

727
00:26:17,240 --> 00:26:17,640
Brother Liang.

728
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:19,200
I just want to know,

729
00:26:19,200 --> 00:26:20,440
do I really have to sign this?

730
00:26:21,519 --> 00:26:22,720
You really do have to sign, Bro.

731
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:23,920
Wait, why does it have to be me?

732
00:26:24,119 --> 00:26:25,319
Uncle Duoxi gave strict orders.

733
00:26:25,319 --> 00:26:26,640
Whoever manages the books signs it.

734
00:26:27,519 --> 00:26:28,000
Sign here.

735
00:26:28,680 --> 00:26:29,119
Where do I sign?

736
00:26:29,279 --> 00:26:30,200
Right here. Right here.

737
00:26:32,279 --> 00:26:32,920
Were the materials inspected?

738
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:33,799
They were checked long ago.

739
00:26:36,160 --> 00:26:37,799
No, couldn't you have just called?

740
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:38,519
Look at this... I...

741
00:26:38,519 --> 00:26:39,400
When materials come in,

742
00:26:39,599 --> 00:26:40,480
when payments are due—

743
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:41,240
I don't know any of it!

744
00:26:41,359 --> 00:26:42,200
How am I supposed to sign off?

745
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:43,599
So do I... do I settle the bill first?

746
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:44,160
If something goes wrong,

747
00:26:44,160 --> 00:26:44,920
will you take the blame?

748
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:45,319
Driver,

749
00:26:45,880 --> 00:26:46,319
hurry up, hurry up.

750
00:26:47,839 --> 00:26:49,160
Your site always causes the most hassle!

751
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:50,359
Next time, truck, materials, and all—

752
00:26:50,359 --> 00:26:51,000
I'll haul it all away!

753
00:26:51,559 --> 00:26:51,839
Big Brother,

754
00:26:52,799 --> 00:26:54,200
you sign off on this from now on, alright?

755
00:26:54,200 --> 00:26:55,119
Now just get the truck out of here.

756
00:26:55,480 --> 00:26:55,880
Second Brother,

757
00:26:56,559 --> 00:26:57,680
let me apologize first.

758
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:58,799
On the phone just now,

759
00:26:59,400 --> 00:27:00,279
I had a bit of an attitude.

760
00:27:00,480 --> 00:27:00,960
Come on,

761
00:27:01,359 --> 00:27:01,640
sit down.

762
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:04,079
Dad...

763
00:27:04,359 --> 00:27:05,319
put you in charge of this business,

764
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:06,640
which means he trusts you.

765
00:27:06,839 --> 00:27:08,039
So you had to be here.

766
00:27:08,359 --> 00:27:10,319
Big Brother, I had no clue

767
00:27:10,319 --> 00:27:11,279
what the old man was planning.

768
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:12,039
If you're going to put it like that,

769
00:27:12,039 --> 00:27:12,920
you're just playing dumb.

770
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:15,240
Aren't you scheming a bit too hard?

771
00:27:15,920 --> 00:27:17,119
You run your own law firm,

772
00:27:17,359 --> 00:27:18,119
yet the family business—

773
00:27:18,279 --> 00:27:18,960
you've still got your eyes on it.

774
00:27:20,839 --> 00:27:21,799
Big Brother, truth be told,

775
00:27:21,799 --> 00:27:22,920
even if you don't like hearing it,

776
00:27:23,759 --> 00:27:24,599
this little business...

777
00:27:24,599 --> 00:27:25,559
I couldn't care less about it.

778
00:27:25,920 --> 00:27:27,599
Only you and Wen Jiayin treat it like treasure.

779
00:27:27,799 --> 00:27:28,279
"Couldn't care less"?

780
00:27:28,279 --> 00:27:29,160
Then why the hell are you meddling?

781
00:27:29,319 --> 00:27:30,240
Drop the innocent act!

782
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:31,880
Wait, you think I want this?

783
00:27:31,960 --> 00:27:33,119
Isn't it because you and Wen Jiayin...

784
00:27:33,119 --> 00:27:35,119
couldn't get the old man to trust you?

785
00:27:35,279 --> 00:27:36,240
I can't even go back home.

786
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:37,279
How am I meddling?

787
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:39,279
Bottom line is, he just doesn't trust you two!

788
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:40,440
That's the simple truth.

789
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:41,799
You pretend to obey him,

790
00:27:41,799 --> 00:27:42,519
but you haven't got a clue

791
00:27:42,519 --> 00:27:43,400
what he actually wants.

792
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:44,880
You guys are just incompetent!

793
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:45,319
Don't point your finger at me—

794
00:27:45,319 --> 00:27:46,160
I will! I'm pointing right at you!

795
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:47,200
You're completely incompetent!

796
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:47,880
If you're so capable,

797
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:49,079
go get that passbook back!

798
00:27:49,079 --> 00:27:50,279
Why are you picking fights with me every day?

799
00:27:50,279 --> 00:27:50,559
Uncle!

800
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:51,480
What's the point of fighting?

801
00:27:51,480 --> 00:27:52,119
Who are you calling incompetent?

802
00:27:52,119 --> 00:27:53,160
I'm calling you incompetent!

803
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:53,720
You're useless!

804
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:54,519
That's right, I said you're useless!

805
00:27:54,519 --> 00:27:54,799
Why, you—

806
00:27:56,359 --> 00:27:58,480
I could see you two bickering from miles away.

807
00:27:58,559 --> 00:27:59,319
What are you yelling about?

808
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:00,440
U-Uncle Wei.

809
00:28:01,200 --> 00:28:01,519
Uncle Wei.

810
00:28:01,799 --> 00:28:03,119
Your dad just got hospitalized,

811
00:28:03,799 --> 00:28:05,240
and you two are already making a shameful scene!

812
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:06,559
With all these workers on the site,

813
00:28:07,039 --> 00:28:07,920
what are they supposed to think?

814
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:13,119
Well, Uncle Wei, since

815
00:28:13,680 --> 00:28:14,319
we ran into each other here,

816
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:15,440
there are a few things

817
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:16,519
I'd like to discuss with you.

818
00:28:17,400 --> 00:28:18,160
Over there. Let's head over there.

819
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:22,039
Stop staring! Get back to work!

820
00:28:22,279 --> 00:28:23,400
Don't just stand around gawking! Move it!

821
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:24,680
Get back to your stations! Back to work!

822
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:25,240
Uncle Wei.

823
00:28:27,359 --> 00:28:27,720
Have a seat.

824
00:28:28,400 --> 00:28:28,720
Um...

825
00:28:28,720 --> 00:28:30,039
there's something I need to brief you on.

826
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:30,799
What is it?

827
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:32,480
You know I opened a law firm, right?

828
00:28:33,279 --> 00:28:33,880
Well,

829
00:28:34,559 --> 00:28:36,839
we're handling Tengyue's legal affairs—

830
00:28:37,359 --> 00:28:38,559
a portion of it, just a part.

831
00:28:39,039 --> 00:28:39,799
And Mr. Shi...

832
00:28:39,799 --> 00:28:40,279
well, he

833
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:42,799
put me in charge of the Changfu buyout.

834
00:28:43,039 --> 00:28:43,440
What did you say?

835
00:28:44,920 --> 00:28:45,200
Wait.

836
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:46,880
I already turned that down.

837
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:48,079
You should know that, right?

838
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:48,720
I know.

839
00:28:49,160 --> 00:28:49,960
Please sit down first. Take a seat.

840
00:28:50,880 --> 00:28:52,160
But that's why I wanted to ask:

841
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:54,200
didn't you agree before?

842
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:56,119
Why the sudden change of heart?

843
00:28:56,400 --> 00:28:56,839
From what I heard,

844
00:28:57,480 --> 00:28:59,160
the buyout offer was actually pretty good.

845
00:28:59,559 --> 00:29:00,839
Just turning it down like this,

846
00:29:00,839 --> 00:29:02,079
isn't that a bad idea?

847
00:29:02,799 --> 00:29:03,759
Why did I change my mind?

848
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:06,640
You should go ask that

849
00:29:07,279 --> 00:29:08,680
sly fox of a father of yours!

850
00:29:09,359 --> 00:29:10,279
What do you mean by that?

851
00:29:11,319 --> 00:29:13,279
Do you have any idea what your dad is planning?

852
00:29:14,079 --> 00:29:15,799
He wants to merge the three teams.

853
00:29:16,279 --> 00:29:16,640
Three?

854
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:20,960
You, our family, and Uncle Ma's?

855
00:29:21,039 --> 00:29:21,400
Yeah.

856
00:29:21,599 --> 00:29:21,960
Wait...

857
00:29:22,519 --> 00:29:23,640
Uncle Wei, listen to me.

858
00:29:23,759 --> 00:29:24,440
My dad...

859
00:29:25,279 --> 00:29:26,200
he's a capable man, no doubt.

860
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:27,519
Back in the day,

861
00:29:27,960 --> 00:29:30,480
raising such a huge family with his bare hands,

862
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:31,359
it really wasn't easy.

863
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:33,680
But times have changed now.

864
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:35,960
That rough-and-tumble era is over.

865
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:37,680
You can't just rely on brute force

866
00:29:37,680 --> 00:29:38,920
and brotherhood loyalty anymore.

867
00:29:39,119 --> 00:29:40,200
Even if you put your life on the line,

868
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:41,480
things just won't work out.

869
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:42,960
With my dad on his own,

870
00:29:43,079 --> 00:29:44,160
running things with a ragtag setup,

871
00:29:44,359 --> 00:29:45,519
managing one or two sites

872
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:46,880
and a hundred or so workers,

873
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:47,720
that was fine.

874
00:29:47,960 --> 00:29:50,279
But future projects will be massive,

875
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:53,440
coordinating dozens of companies and crews!

876
00:29:53,880 --> 00:29:55,240
Can a contractor just puff his chest out

877
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:56,720
and expect them to hand over the job?

878
00:29:57,359 --> 00:29:58,880
Uncle, you watched me grow up.

879
00:29:59,519 --> 00:30:00,880
You've eaten more salt

880
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:02,039
than I've eaten bowls of rice.

881
00:30:02,039 --> 00:30:03,039
You must know this.

882
00:30:03,519 --> 00:30:05,279
Merging the three teams right now,

883
00:30:05,599 --> 00:30:06,799
isn't that just a dead end?

884
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:07,759
Why put yourself through that?

885
00:30:08,839 --> 00:30:09,720
Xiuliang...

886
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:11,480
Everything you just said,

887
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:12,720
do you think I don't get it?

888
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:14,480
It's precisely because I get it

889
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:15,599
that I'm in such a tough spot!

890
00:30:15,799 --> 00:30:16,319
Let me tell you:

891
00:30:16,599 --> 00:30:19,359
the moment I sell Changfu to Tengyue,

892
00:30:20,079 --> 00:30:21,559
your dad's and Uncle Ma's crews

893
00:30:22,160 --> 00:30:23,559
will be pushed out immediately.

894
00:30:27,319 --> 00:30:29,319
Shi Yongnian didn't tell you this, did he?

895
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:33,440
He's a very calculating man.

896
00:30:33,440 --> 00:30:34,799
Even I'm no match for him.

897
00:30:36,519 --> 00:30:37,119
Xiuliang.

898
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:38,799
Take my advice.

899
00:30:39,400 --> 00:30:40,839
Get out while you still can.

900
00:30:41,359 --> 00:30:42,359
The pie in the sky he promised you...

901
00:30:42,599 --> 00:30:43,599
isn't easy to swallow.

902
00:30:46,319 --> 00:30:46,680
Uncle Wei.

903
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:49,400
Whether we get cleared out or not, set that aside.

904
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:51,279
Look at where things stand right now.

905
00:30:51,960 --> 00:30:53,880
Huddling together for warmth... it...

906
00:30:55,200 --> 00:30:56,839
It's better to pull back and quit while we're ahead.

907
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:57,759
Don't you think?

908
00:30:58,000 --> 00:30:59,920
So you want me to betray my brother?

909
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:00,960
Betray your father?

910
00:31:01,279 --> 00:31:02,160
Sabotage your own dad?

911
00:31:02,160 --> 00:31:03,680
No, no, Uncle Wei, don't say betrayal.

912
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:04,599
That's way too harsh.

913
00:31:05,039 --> 00:31:06,359
Just tell me where you stand.

914
00:31:07,079 --> 00:31:08,400
Since I gave your dad my word,

915
00:31:08,920 --> 00:31:09,240
then

916
00:31:09,759 --> 00:31:10,839
my word is my bond.

917
00:31:11,279 --> 00:31:13,319
I have to drag our three families forward,

918
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:15,400
through hell or high water. No turning back.

919
00:31:15,400 --> 00:31:16,119
Uncle. Uncle Wei.

920
00:31:16,119 --> 00:31:19,039
The point is, Mr. Shi has made up his mind.

921
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:21,079
He won't stop until he gets what he wants.

922
00:31:21,519 --> 00:31:22,680
Just consider this one thing:

923
00:31:23,160 --> 00:31:24,559
If the phase three payment doesn't clear,

924
00:31:24,720 --> 00:31:26,039
and with inspections coming up...

925
00:31:26,799 --> 00:31:27,400
Sai Xiuliang.

926
00:31:28,039 --> 00:31:29,640
In what capacity are you talking to me?

927
00:31:30,079 --> 00:31:31,039
Are you my brother's son,

928
00:31:31,039 --> 00:31:32,079
or Shi Yongnian's henchman?

929
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:34,160
If you're Sai Duoxi's son,

930
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:34,960
then let me tell you this:

931
00:31:35,519 --> 00:31:36,839
Tell Shi Yongnian to bring it on!

932
00:31:37,160 --> 00:31:38,720
I'd like to see what he's made of.

933
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:40,200
I've spent 20 years in Honggang,

934
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:40,960
and it wasn't for nothing.

935
00:31:41,400 --> 00:31:42,519
But right now, this construction site...

936
00:31:42,519 --> 00:31:43,880
is in your hands, Xiuliang.

937
00:31:44,359 --> 00:31:46,279
Future reworks, fines,

938
00:31:46,519 --> 00:31:47,359
or damages...

939
00:31:47,839 --> 00:31:49,559
The blow will fall squarely on your head.

940
00:31:50,079 --> 00:31:51,960
But if you're Shi Yongnian's henchman,

941
00:31:52,799 --> 00:31:53,880
then I have nothing to say to you.

942
00:31:58,559 --> 00:31:59,799
Sai Xiuliang feels like

943
00:32:00,759 --> 00:32:03,240
he's waiting on a bunch of living ancestors.

944
00:32:04,640 --> 00:32:06,680
He wants to please everyone,

945
00:32:08,119 --> 00:32:11,400
but they're all giving him a hard time.

946
00:32:32,759 --> 00:32:33,599
Wen Jiayin, come over here.

947
00:32:33,599 --> 00:32:34,359
I need to talk to you.

948
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:46,759
What brings you back so suddenly?

949
00:32:47,599 --> 00:32:48,359
Have you eaten yet?

950
00:32:48,759 --> 00:32:49,160
There's food on the stove.

951
00:32:49,160 --> 00:32:49,759
I'll heat it up for you.

952
00:32:49,759 --> 00:32:50,599
Cut the act.

953
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:52,240
About the construction site,

954
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:53,359
let's have it out.

955
00:32:55,599 --> 00:32:56,599
About the site,

956
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:58,359
you don't need to tell me.

957
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:00,839
You and Dad...

958
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:02,319
one minute you're at each other's throats,

959
00:33:02,720 --> 00:33:03,839
the next you're playing loving father and son.

960
00:33:04,279 --> 00:33:05,519
Whatever game you two are playing,

961
00:33:05,839 --> 00:33:06,640
we can never guess.

962
00:33:07,559 --> 00:33:08,519
Not that it matters.

963
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:10,319
As long as father and son are united,

964
00:33:10,319 --> 00:33:11,119
whatever you decide,

965
00:33:11,119 --> 00:33:11,880
we'll just go along with it.

966
00:33:11,880 --> 00:33:13,160
"Whatever you decide, we'll go along"?

967
00:33:13,839 --> 00:33:15,039
Even buying a single screw for the site,

968
00:33:15,039 --> 00:33:16,240
I have to sign for it in person.

969
00:33:16,559 --> 00:33:17,839
A phone call authorizing it isn't enough.

970
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:19,079
That was your idea, wasn't it?

971
00:33:19,079 --> 00:33:20,559
Xiuliang, you're really doing me an injustice here.

972
00:33:21,359 --> 00:33:22,599
How could that be my idea?

973
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:24,240
Dad handed the account books to you.

974
00:33:24,440 --> 00:33:25,680
That was Dad's rule.

975
00:33:31,480 --> 00:33:32,400
There are no outsiders here today.

976
00:33:32,400 --> 00:33:34,039
Let's lay our cards on the table.

977
00:33:34,720 --> 00:33:36,400
All this mess with the family construction team,

978
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:38,640
I never wanted any part of it.

979
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:39,640
Did you hear me?

980
00:33:39,880 --> 00:33:40,599
About my resignation,

981
00:33:40,599 --> 00:33:41,720
you stabbed me in the back.

982
00:33:41,839 --> 00:33:42,839
And I should actually thank you.

983
00:33:42,880 --> 00:33:43,519
My whole life,

984
00:33:43,519 --> 00:33:45,160
the old man never laid a finger on me.

985
00:33:45,839 --> 00:33:46,519
Right on Mid-Autumn Festival,

986
00:33:46,519 --> 00:33:47,359
I got slapped across the face.

987
00:33:47,359 --> 00:33:48,240
Leaving this family?

988
00:33:48,519 --> 00:33:48,880
Fine by me!

989
00:33:49,200 --> 00:33:50,119
I can finally be myself.

990
00:33:50,519 --> 00:33:51,359
All the drama in this house,

991
00:33:51,359 --> 00:33:52,440
I don't have to deal with it anymore.

992
00:33:52,599 --> 00:33:53,759
What you obsess over every single day—

993
00:33:53,759 --> 00:33:54,559
dividing the money,

994
00:33:54,720 --> 00:33:55,359
taking over the business—

995
00:33:55,359 --> 00:33:56,160
in my eyes,

996
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:56,759
let me tell you,

997
00:33:57,039 --> 00:33:57,839
none of it means a damn thing.

998
00:33:58,359 --> 00:33:59,039
I'm free.

999
00:33:59,359 --> 00:34:00,480
You want all that stuff?

1000
00:34:00,720 --> 00:34:02,160
If you've got what it takes, fight for it yourself.

1001
00:34:02,359 --> 00:34:03,359
I won't say another word.

1002
00:34:03,640 --> 00:34:04,519
But the account books?

1003
00:34:04,920 --> 00:34:06,519
Before the old man went to the hospital,

1004
00:34:06,720 --> 00:34:07,519
he gave them to Old Ma,

1005
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:09,480
and Old Ma practically forced them into my hands.

1006
00:34:09,519 --> 00:34:10,320
I didn't want them!

1007
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:11,320
He gave them to you, so you manage them.

1008
00:34:11,760 --> 00:34:12,480
No need to explain it to me.

1009
00:34:12,480 --> 00:34:13,880
First of all, I don't owe you any explanation.

1010
00:34:13,880 --> 00:34:15,320
What do I have to explain to you anyway?

1011
00:34:15,599 --> 00:34:16,599
Second, how am I supposed to manage them?

1012
00:34:16,719 --> 00:34:17,199
Tell me,

1013
00:34:17,199 --> 00:34:17,920
how?

1014
00:34:18,079 --> 00:34:19,679
You've been in this family for nearly twenty years.

1015
00:34:19,800 --> 00:34:21,320
If you truly cared about Sai Xiuming,

1016
00:34:21,320 --> 00:34:22,239
and what's best for this family,

1017
00:34:22,519 --> 00:34:23,400
wouldn't the old man know?

1018
00:34:23,639 --> 00:34:25,360
Why would he hand the account books to me?

1019
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:27,880
Isn't it because he saw right through who you are?

1020
00:34:28,199 --> 00:34:28,960
Someone like you,

1021
00:34:29,199 --> 00:34:31,760
you scheme too much and care too little.

1022
00:34:31,920 --> 00:34:33,119
You're just a Wang Xifeng,

1023
00:34:33,519 --> 00:34:34,400
and you don't even realize it.

1024
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:48,199
Xiuliang, I'm sorry.

1025
00:34:48,519 --> 00:34:49,400
About what happened on Mid-Autumn Festival,

1026
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:50,039
I was wrong.

1027
00:34:50,039 --> 00:34:50,840
I'm apologizing to you.

1028
00:34:51,280 --> 00:34:52,440
Ever since you took that slap,

1029
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:52,880
I couldn't...

1030
00:34:53,840 --> 00:34:55,280
I just couldn't let it go in my heart.

1031
00:34:55,800 --> 00:34:57,159
If I didn't truly regret it,

1032
00:34:57,519 --> 00:34:59,199
would I swallow my pride and buy such pricey cosmetics

1033
00:34:59,199 --> 00:35:00,280
just to apologize to Meifan?

1034
00:35:00,559 --> 00:35:02,039
I'd never even spend that on myself.

1035
00:35:02,159 --> 00:35:03,039
I only tested it at the counter.

1036
00:35:03,039 --> 00:35:04,599
Did you really go apologize to Meifan?

1037
00:35:04,599 --> 00:35:04,880
Yes.

1038
00:35:05,079 --> 00:35:05,960
Look into my eyes.

1039
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:06,920
Say it again. You went to apolo—

1040
00:35:06,920 --> 00:35:07,400
Yes!

1041
00:35:14,599 --> 00:35:14,840
Fine.

1042
00:35:16,519 --> 00:35:18,360
I'll propose a workable plan.

1043
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:19,760
From now on, at the construction site,

1044
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:22,079
for petty matters under twenty thousand yuan,

1045
00:35:22,239 --> 00:35:24,920
you, Sai Xiuming, and Yang Qingyou

1046
00:35:25,199 --> 00:35:26,239
all have signing authority.

1047
00:35:26,239 --> 00:35:27,400
You can handle them yourselves.

1048
00:35:27,559 --> 00:35:28,800
For anything over twenty thousand,

1049
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:29,679
call me.

1050
00:35:29,840 --> 00:35:31,159
I'll authorize it over the phone.

1051
00:35:31,360 --> 00:35:31,639
And another thing.

1052
00:35:31,920 --> 00:35:34,400
I'll visit the site at least twice a week.

1053
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:35,159
How's that sound?

1054
00:35:38,159 --> 00:35:38,719
Xiuliang,

1055
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:41,320
you sure act like a big shot, don't you?

1056
00:35:41,559 --> 00:35:42,159
Dad put you in charge of the books,

1057
00:35:42,159 --> 00:35:43,039
and this is how you manage them?

1058
00:35:43,639 --> 00:35:44,920
Splitting them into big and small accounts?

1059
00:35:45,960 --> 00:35:46,920
You're the real Wang Xifeng here.

1060
00:35:47,039 --> 00:35:48,440
Did I not make myself clear enough?

1061
00:35:48,440 --> 00:35:49,199
About what goes on at the site,

1062
00:35:49,199 --> 00:35:50,519
how much do you even know?

1063
00:35:50,960 --> 00:35:52,719
The site barely sees once or twice a month

1064
00:35:52,719 --> 00:35:54,039
an expense over twenty thousand yuan.

1065
00:35:54,239 --> 00:35:55,440
How many petty matters are left?

1066
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:56,079
Do you have any idea?

1067
00:35:56,440 --> 00:35:58,079
So we're all just working for you now?

1068
00:35:58,079 --> 00:35:59,079
So, the plan I proposed...

1069
00:35:59,079 --> 00:36:00,000
you don't agree with it, right?

1070
00:36:00,239 --> 00:36:00,880
Then make your own proposal.

1071
00:36:01,079 --> 00:36:01,440
Go ahead.

1072
00:36:03,639 --> 00:36:03,960
Fine.

1073
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:06,320
Then I will.

1074
00:36:07,239 --> 00:36:09,199
Dad used to go to the site every day.

1075
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:11,320
I suggest that starting tomorrow,

1076
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:12,519
you go to the site every single day.

1077
00:36:13,159 --> 00:36:14,119
Your older brother has his hands full.

1078
00:36:14,519 --> 00:36:15,280
The mess with the Ma family...

1079
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:15,920
he still has to deal with that.

1080
00:36:16,199 --> 00:36:17,719
Since Dad gave you the account books,

1081
00:36:17,920 --> 00:36:19,880
he decided you're the backbone of this family.

1082
00:36:20,239 --> 00:36:21,199
So everything in this family

1083
00:36:22,440 --> 00:36:23,360
is your responsibility.

1084
00:36:27,679 --> 00:36:28,119
Just you wait,

1085
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:34,239
Wang Xifeng.

1086
00:36:45,119 --> 00:36:45,800
Ma Laijiao!

1087
00:36:46,960 --> 00:36:47,679
Ma Laijiao!

1088
00:36:49,519 --> 00:36:50,159
Ma Laijiao!

1089
00:36:50,920 --> 00:36:51,920
Come give me a hand.

1090
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:54,039
Brother Xiuming!

1091
00:36:54,239 --> 00:36:54,719
Hold this for me.

1092
00:36:56,119 --> 00:36:57,159
Come on in.

1093
00:36:58,599 --> 00:36:58,880
Uncle.

1094
00:36:58,880 --> 00:36:59,480
Brother Xiuming is here!

1095
00:36:59,679 --> 00:37:00,519
Xiuming, you're here.

1096
00:37:01,239 --> 00:37:02,840
I came to help you pack.

1097
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:04,199
How thoughtful of you.

1098
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:06,199
Dad, I'll take him inside first.

1099
00:37:06,440 --> 00:37:07,079
Go on ahead.

1100
00:37:07,079 --> 00:37:07,719
Let me pack for you first.

1101
00:37:08,280 --> 00:37:08,599
All right.

1102
00:37:19,800 --> 00:37:20,079
Jiao,

1103
00:37:20,519 --> 00:37:21,199
help me take that

1104
00:37:22,639 --> 00:37:23,039
inside.

1105
00:37:32,199 --> 00:37:32,639
Jiao.

1106
00:37:33,239 --> 00:37:34,320
This room is so stuffy.

1107
00:37:34,719 --> 00:37:35,880
C-Could you go to that door

1108
00:37:36,280 --> 00:37:36,679
and open it,

1109
00:37:36,920 --> 00:37:37,840
to air the room out?

1110
00:37:39,079 --> 00:37:39,360
Okay.

1111
00:38:13,280 --> 00:38:13,639
Jiao.

1112
00:38:14,280 --> 00:38:15,599
What I brought today...

1113
00:38:15,599 --> 00:38:16,320
...might not be right.

1114
00:38:16,840 --> 00:38:18,159
I'll have to come back another day.

1115
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:19,360
Okay.

1116
00:38:20,199 --> 00:38:21,039
Then I'll... I'll go...

1117
00:38:21,559 --> 00:38:22,079
...look for one.

1118
00:38:22,079 --> 00:38:22,400
All right.

1119
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:23,599
I'll head out then.

1120
00:38:25,440 --> 00:38:26,039
I'll leave this to you.

1121
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:27,119
I'll walk you out.

1122
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,159
Here, let me take your bag.

1123
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:43,239
Allow me, allow me.

1124
00:38:48,440 --> 00:38:48,719
Here.

1125
00:38:49,639 --> 00:38:49,960
Let's order.

1126
00:38:51,079 --> 00:38:52,239
Splurging today, are we?

1127
00:38:52,519 --> 00:38:52,920
You think so?

1128
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:53,880
It's alright.

1129
00:38:55,639 --> 00:38:56,159
What do you recommend?

1130
00:38:56,719 --> 00:38:57,239
Sir, ma'am.

1131
00:38:57,599 --> 00:38:59,400
We have a new couples set meal.

1132
00:38:59,760 --> 00:39:00,679
It's a much better deal than à la carte.

1133
00:39:01,039 --> 00:39:02,360
Would you two like to try it?

1134
00:39:02,360 --> 00:39:03,360
Whether it's a good deal

1135
00:39:03,360 --> 00:39:03,800
doesn't matter.

1136
00:39:04,159 --> 00:39:05,119
A couples set meal—

1137
00:39:05,119 --> 00:39:05,840
I like the sound of that.

1138
00:39:06,039 --> 00:39:06,599
We'll take it.

1139
00:39:06,840 --> 00:39:07,840
Do you have a kids' meal?

1140
00:39:08,199 --> 00:39:08,920
He's my nephew.

1141
00:39:11,079 --> 00:39:12,840
We might be family in this life,

1142
00:39:13,440 --> 00:39:15,000
but we could've been lovers in the last.

1143
00:39:15,239 --> 00:39:16,800
And in the next, we'll be family again.

1144
00:39:17,639 --> 00:39:18,119
Let's get this.

1145
00:39:18,320 --> 00:39:18,960
The couples set meal.

1146
00:39:20,119 --> 00:39:20,760
He's paying.

1147
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:21,480
Up to him.

1148
00:39:21,880 --> 00:39:22,159
Right away!

1149
00:39:22,280 --> 00:39:22,719
Thanks.

1150
00:39:25,079 --> 00:39:26,119
What about the place you were finding me?

1151
00:39:26,480 --> 00:39:28,039
Didn't you say there'd be better ones?

1152
00:39:28,039 --> 00:39:29,039
House hunting is a big deal.

1153
00:39:29,559 --> 00:39:30,199
You can't rush it.

1154
00:39:31,119 --> 00:39:32,719
I've been really busy the past few days.

1155
00:39:32,960 --> 00:39:34,280
I'm looking after the old man at the hospital.

1156
00:39:34,599 --> 00:39:36,280
Just give me a little more time.

1157
00:39:36,679 --> 00:39:38,039
Aren't you filial.

1158
00:39:38,679 --> 00:39:40,280
I'm Qingyangli Village's most filial son.

1159
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:41,280
Didn't you know?

1160
00:39:41,280 --> 00:39:41,880
Tell me something.

1161
00:39:42,000 --> 00:39:44,199
Ma Laibu was running his mouth, saying

1162
00:39:44,679 --> 00:39:45,599
you want to date me.

1163
00:39:46,199 --> 00:39:47,039
Is that true?

1164
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:52,079
Yes.

1165
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:54,800
Can I?

1166
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:04,599
Enjoy your meal.

1167
00:40:05,519 --> 00:40:06,239
Nephew,

1168
00:40:07,199 --> 00:40:08,599
we're a generation apart.

1169
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:10,440
You call Ma Jiucheng "Uncle."

1170
00:40:10,840 --> 00:40:12,719
I call his wife "Sister."

1171
00:40:12,960 --> 00:40:14,039
I'm Ma Laibu's aunt.

1172
00:40:14,039 --> 00:40:15,400
You should be calling me "Aunt," too.

1173
00:40:15,599 --> 00:40:15,960
Auntie,

1174
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:18,400
I'm a man,

1175
00:40:18,400 --> 00:40:19,199
you're a woman.

1176
00:40:19,199 --> 00:40:20,239
Both of us are single.

1177
00:40:20,639 --> 00:40:22,119
You call Uncle Ma's wife "Sister,"

1178
00:40:22,119 --> 00:40:23,559
not my mom.

1179
00:40:24,280 --> 00:40:25,039
As for generations,

1180
00:40:25,159 --> 00:40:26,159
even the law doesn't care.

1181
00:40:26,239 --> 00:40:26,840
People are free to love.

1182
00:40:27,960 --> 00:40:28,960
Right, Auntie?

1183
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:31,159
What do you even like about me?

1184
00:40:31,159 --> 00:40:31,719
You're pretty.

1185
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:32,800
Capable.

1186
00:40:33,079 --> 00:40:33,440
Feisty.

1187
00:40:33,519 --> 00:40:34,440
Well, do you have money?

1188
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:38,280
What does love have to do with money?

1189
00:40:38,440 --> 00:40:39,159
My dear nephew,

1190
00:40:39,400 --> 00:40:41,880
romance costs money.

1191
00:40:42,199 --> 00:40:43,239
I might not have money now,

1192
00:40:43,239 --> 00:40:44,079
but I can make it later.

1193
00:40:44,159 --> 00:40:45,559
Then you'd better hurry.

1194
00:40:45,559 --> 00:40:47,239
Ma Laibu is practically walking all over you.

1195
00:40:47,400 --> 00:40:49,039
Having thick skin alone won't cut it.

1196
00:40:51,119 --> 00:40:52,599
Why are you just sitting there? Eat up.

1197
00:40:52,920 --> 00:40:53,960
It's a couples meal.

1198
00:40:54,159 --> 00:40:54,960
It'd be a waste not to eat.

1199
00:41:03,440 --> 00:41:03,840
What's wrong?

1200
00:41:04,480 --> 00:41:05,320
You look completely drained.

1201
00:41:10,079 --> 00:41:11,760
I saw Uncle Wei at the site today.

1202
00:41:13,119 --> 00:41:13,519
He said

1203
00:41:14,079 --> 00:41:15,960
once Tengyue completes the buyout of Changfu,

1204
00:41:15,960 --> 00:41:17,440
they're dismissing the Sai family's crew.

1205
00:41:19,199 --> 00:41:19,679
Why?

1206
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:21,000
I couldn't figure it out either.

1207
00:41:21,639 --> 00:41:23,519
Shi Yongnian didn't breathe a word about this.

1208
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:25,199
It's like he deliberately kept me in the dark.

1209
00:41:25,559 --> 00:41:26,440
Honey, do you think

1210
00:41:26,440 --> 00:41:27,360
there's some kind of trap here?

1211
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:30,960
I doubt it's a trap.

1212
00:41:31,679 --> 00:41:33,039
Shi Yongnian is a major tycoon.

1213
00:41:33,920 --> 00:41:34,920
Compared to your dad and Uncle Wei,

1214
00:41:34,920 --> 00:41:36,000
they're not even in the same league.

1215
00:41:36,920 --> 00:41:37,840
He wouldn't go out of his way to target them.

1216
00:41:38,519 --> 00:41:40,079
Still, I don't think it's that simple.

1217
00:41:40,079 --> 00:41:41,119
Something fishy is definitely going on.

1218
00:41:42,960 --> 00:41:44,719
You can rack your brain all day and get nowhere.

1219
00:41:45,599 --> 00:41:47,599
Why don't you just call Shi Yongnian and ask?

1220
00:42:04,840 --> 00:42:05,159
Hello?

1221
00:42:05,320 --> 00:42:05,679
Mr. Shi.

1222
00:42:06,239 --> 00:42:06,760
Attorney Sai.

1223
00:42:07,480 --> 00:42:08,039
What's on your mind?

1224
00:42:08,719 --> 00:42:10,199
I ran into Wei Changfu today

1225
00:42:10,679 --> 00:42:12,079
and talked with him about the acquisition.

1226
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:14,840
I heard that once it goes through,

1227
00:42:14,840 --> 00:42:17,119
both the Sai and Ma construction teams will be cut?

1228
00:42:18,599 --> 00:42:19,800
Yes, that's right.

1229
00:42:20,280 --> 00:42:20,880
Why is that?

1230
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:22,840
They've worked together for years,

1231
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:24,639
and there haven't been any major issues.

1232
00:42:25,400 --> 00:42:26,360
It's not just the two of them.

1233
00:42:26,920 --> 00:42:28,480
Anyone failing to meet Tengyue's standards

1234
00:42:28,719 --> 00:42:29,239
will be dismissed across the board.

1235
00:42:30,119 --> 00:42:31,119
In my book,

1236
00:42:31,639 --> 00:42:32,760
quality always comes first.

1237
00:42:33,599 --> 00:42:35,119
Otherwise, why would I bother acquiring Changfu?

1238
00:42:35,360 --> 00:42:35,599
Well...

1239
00:42:37,639 --> 00:42:38,920
Mr. Shi, about this,

1240
00:42:39,679 --> 00:42:41,280
you didn't mention it to me beforehand.

1241
00:42:41,800 --> 00:42:43,039
So on my end, I...

1242
00:42:43,159 --> 00:42:43,920
Does that even need to be said?

1243
00:42:44,159 --> 00:42:45,280
Since we're buying Changfu,

1244
00:42:45,599 --> 00:42:46,559
the work naturally has to meet

1245
00:42:46,559 --> 00:42:48,280
Tengyue's standards and requirements.

1246
00:42:49,239 --> 00:42:49,800
I thought

1247
00:42:50,519 --> 00:42:51,480
we had an understanding on this.

1248
00:42:52,320 --> 00:42:52,880
Attorney Sai,

1249
00:42:53,559 --> 00:42:53,880
tell you what.

1250
00:42:54,559 --> 00:42:56,079
If you feel caught in a bind,

1251
00:42:56,679 --> 00:42:57,639
we can still terminate our agreement now.

1252
00:42:58,119 --> 00:42:59,440
You can still walk away clean.

1253
00:42:59,519 --> 00:42:59,920
No, no, no.

1254
00:43:00,119 --> 00:43:01,079
That's not what I meant.

1255
00:43:01,639 --> 00:43:02,000
I...

1256
00:43:02,880 --> 00:43:04,840
I'll report back once there's progress, Mr. Shi.

1257
00:43:05,559 --> 00:43:05,960
Goodbye.

1258
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:21,119
Let's agree on this first.

1259
00:43:22,639 --> 00:43:23,480
Don't get mad.

1260
00:43:26,280 --> 00:43:27,440
The old man gave me the ledger.

1261
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:27,960
What?

1262
00:43:28,679 --> 00:43:29,760
Aren't we 40,000 yuan short right now?

1263
00:43:30,079 --> 00:43:30,880
Between the four of us, each family...

1264
00:43:31,159 --> 00:43:31,639
ten thousand each.

1265
00:43:31,639 --> 00:43:32,639
Put my ten thousand on your tab.

1266
00:43:32,880 --> 00:43:33,519
Cover it for me first.

1267
00:43:33,639 --> 00:43:34,480
Your big brother...

1268
00:43:35,000 --> 00:43:37,000
only makes 3,000 yuan a month.

1269
00:43:37,039 --> 00:43:39,039
He barely has any spare cash.

1270
00:43:39,159 --> 00:43:39,559
Second Brother,

1271
00:43:40,119 --> 00:43:41,000
can I ask you something?

1272
00:43:41,039 --> 00:43:41,440
Go ahead.

1273
00:43:41,920 --> 00:43:43,199
Dad's passbook...

1274
00:43:43,320 --> 00:43:44,039
do you have it?
